From: Senemos Maintainers <75160848+MCC45TR@users.noreply.github.com>
Subject: [PATCH] backlight: ktz8866: keep a visible Uke minimum while unblanked

Clamp user brightness to one percent while the panel is active. Preserve zero
output when the backlight core blanks or suspends the display, and retain the
requested level only after both chips accept the transaction.

--- a/drivers/video/backlight/ktz8866.c
+++ b/drivers/video/backlight/ktz8866.c
@@ -178,6 +178,8 @@ static int ktz8866_uke_update_status(struct backlight_device *backlight_dev)
 
 	if (level > MAX_BRIGHTNESS)
 		return -EINVAL;
+	if (!backlight_is_blank(backlight_dev) && level < DIV_ROUND_UP(MAX_BRIGHTNESS, 100))
+		level = DIV_ROUND_UP(MAX_BRIGHTNESS, 100);
 	code = ktz8866_uke_code(level);
 	mutex_lock(&ktz->lock);
 	for (i = 0; i < 2; i++) {
@@ -212,6 +214,8 @@ static int ktz8866_uke_update_status(struct backlight_device *backlight_dev)
 		ret = rollback;
 	}
 unlock:
+	if (!ret && !backlight_is_blank(backlight_dev))
+		backlight_dev->props.brightness = level;
 	mutex_unlock(&ktz->lock);
 	return ret;
 }
